


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_dc82fa61:



    voice "2HI_0609"
    hina "「那边的已经可以吃了喔？这边的……还差点再等会」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_ba0a16c4:


    "就算火锅都吃了一半了，阳菜也仍是很热情的用心撇去浮沫，补充食材。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_91935ddd:



    voice "2FU_0517"
    fumi "「阳菜也记得吃啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_1df3aff8:



    voice "2HI_0610"
    hina "「嗯，别担心，你看」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_bd298e77:


    "阳菜戳了戳自己碟子里放着的几个螃蟹腿。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_3cfc23da:



    voice "2FU_0518"
    fumi "「还好，阳菜真是优秀的火锅服务员」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_5214a049:



    voice "2HI_0611"
    hina "「谢谢，是小文帮着把蔬菜切好的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_30e15241:



    voice "2FU_0519"
    fumi "「是我切的，有没切好的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_e31267b3:



    voice "2HI_0612"
    hina "「不是，完全相反，白的部分和绿的部分都分好了，而且大小还都一样，文做起事来真的很认真」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_538e114a:


    "阳菜夹起白菜很佩服地说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_c58cb672:



    voice "2FU_0520"
    fumi "「嗯，这两个熟的时间不一样嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_e54eac35:



    voice "2HI_0613"
    hina "「我家就基本上很粗糙了，随便切几刀就一锅倒进去了，每次都跟搞野炊似的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_b131ee42:



    voice "2FU_0521"
    fumi "「啊哈，而我家是开蛋糕房的，做什么都不自觉地计量起来」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_61e021e2:



    voice "2HI_0614"
    hina "「真有趣。这边的螃蟹腿正好能吃了，别等老了，你吃吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_d94b4f7e:


    "说着阳菜往文的碗里夹了只螃蟹腿。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_5c80b5f6:



    voice "2FU_0522"
    fumi "「谢谢，阳菜好体贴」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_efe81e01:



    voice "2HI_0615"
    hina "「嘿嘿嘿♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_94da3e20:



    voice "2SA_0405"
    sachiko "「可真要好呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_284bf85b:


    "坐在桌对面的祥子拿着小酒碟品着感叹道。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_0321a677:



    voice "2RI_0617"
    rin "「哎，真的是好得不得了，我都不知道怎么说了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_500d00d3:



    voice "2SA_0406"
    sachiko "「嘿嘿，是不是她俩这么亲热把屋里温度都弄高了？话说真是热啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_89f9a40e:



    voice "2RI_0618"
    rin "「什么亲热，你觉得热是因为在喝酒啊，而且我们又在吃火锅」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_8b8a7687:



    voice "2SA_0407"
    sachiko "「啊，是呢，那阳菜亲和文文关系好，伦干嘛觉得无语？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_0de1c257:



    voice "2HI_0616"
    hina "「哎？怎么了？我们俩让伦苦恼了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_796dfa5b:



    voice "2FU_0523"
    fumi "「对不起……没注意到」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_824f39ba:



    voice "2RI_0619"
    rin "「不是，关系好本身没什么，毕竟见证你们誓言的也是我」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_4a14d49b:


    "圣诞节前夜在教堂的婚礼那次。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_b1038b0b:



    voice "2RI_0620"
    rin "「只是，我希望你们能再稍微有点分寸」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_7c94d8da:



    voice "2HI_0617"
    hina "「有点分寸是什么意思」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_4345b6c3:



    voice "2SA_0408"
    sachiko "「什么什么？发生了什么事了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_0092059f:



    voice "2RI_0621"
    rin "「嗯挺多事的呢，不过最严重的还是正月参拜那次——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_29ceb0d7:



    voice "2FU_0524"
    fumi "「啊！那次是——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_7e2c8fe2:


    "听出下文的文立刻想阻止伦继续说下去，却没来得及。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_53ef6761:



    voice "2RI_0622B"
    rin "「那天我和圣夜夜回来后，看到这俩人在客厅裸着抱在一起睡着了啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_7c0788a2:



    voice "2SA_0409"
    sachiko "「噢噢！这是事后了吧？事后吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_f61deeff:



    voice "2RI_0623"
    rin "「难道不是吗～？做了好多然后累得直接睡过去了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_50d53b76:



    voice "2SA_0410"
    sachiko "「呀啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_6ecfdcc8:



    voice "2HI_0618"
    hina "「我们没做，本来是有打算做的……但抱在一起就觉得特别舒服，等发现时已经睡过去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_2ea534f8:


    rin_sachiko "「呀啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_d381588a:


    "阳菜毫不掩饰的话语透露出无比的青涩甜美，伦和祥子都受不了而发出悲鸣。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_5c88a738:



    voice "2FU_0525"
    fumi "「阳菜、阳菜……！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_000f79d5:


    "满面通红的文和赤裸裸的阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_71d2f70a:



    voice "2SA_0412"
    sachiko "「嗯，毕竟是四人间，睁一只眼闭一只眼吧，放过这么纯洁的阳菜吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_fbd154f9:



    voice "2RI_0625"
    rin "「我明白，我并没觉得什么，就是想逗逗她们俩」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_2de4bb68:



    voice "2SA_0413"
    sachiko "「嗯……这点我很能理解」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_9e6f0ff1:



    voice "2SA_0414"
    sachiko "「你们俩和我说嘛，这个房间随时都能借给你俩享用呢。钟点房3小时，想用的时候请拨打内线9」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_64c87091:



    voice "2FU_0526"
    fumi "「钟点房？内线9？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_d21a744d:


    "没弄明白的文歪歪头重复道。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_84b6650e:



    voice "2SA_0415"
    sachiko "「啊，钟点房的意思是——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_f4c86e37:



    voice "2HI_0619"
    hina "「喂！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_9bf45eb7:


    "吧嗒！"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_e9558227:


    "阳菜从桌底下朝着祥子的膝盖就是一脚。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_7b3b08d1:



    voice "2SA_0416"
    sachiko "「呜噗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_0f2c8154:



    voice "2HI_0620"
    hina "「虽然不知道什么意思，但肯定是什么很色情的东西！不准教给小文这些黄色的东西！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_fb935cd1:



    voice "2RI_0626"
    rin "「明明什么都不懂，只有直觉倒挺厉害的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_d505f517:


    "也可以说是祥子平时就太不正经了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_b0a863a0:



    voice "2FU_0527"
    fumi "「那个，绪方同学，钟点房是什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_2dfe49fa:


    "依然很好奇的文向伦提问。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_25e2a4b2:



    voice "2RI_0627"
    rin "「NO！我要是说了肯定会被阳菜踢飞的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_c6de1b38:



    voice "2HI_0621"
    hina "「嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_286a038e:


    "阳菜重重地赞同道。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_48120c44:



    voice "2RI_0628"
    rin "「总之呢，意思就是希望你们能考虑下那天看到你俩那情景的我」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_bcb71d28:



    voice "2FU_0528"
    fumi "「嗯……会注意的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_ba6729ca:



    voice "2RI_0629"
    rin "「我可和两位不一样，还是十分寂寞的单身狗呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_18f71e1a:



    voice "2HI_0622"
    hina "「伦，你这就不对了，净说些闹情绪的话」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_5831e159:



    voice "2RI_0630"
    rin "「哎？干嘛？用那么怜悯……不，不对，站在高处满是慈爱地往下看的过来人的眼神？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_09fe9c87:



    voice "2RI_0630a"
    rin "「为什么连钟点房都不知道是什么意思的小孩子能有这么成年人的表情？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_dcba9947:



    voice "2HI_0623"
    hina "「我不知道你在讲什么，总之呢，你总这么别扭可是会一直单身的。对，会变成祥子姐这种孤单的大人的喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_4f55338e:



    voice "2SA_0417"
    sachiko "「喂！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_974b2d24:


    "祥子突然被阳菜的话打了右脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_cb1ae247:



    voice "2RI_0631"
    rin "「哇，绝对不要！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_152fa59b:



    voice "2SA_0418"
    sachiko "「喂喂！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_1ee9f957:


    "左脸也被打。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_9bf0b0db:



    voice "2RI_0632"
    rin "「圣夜夜，总之先跟我交往吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_44232d49:



    voice "2MI_0527"
    miyako "「……啊？什么？不好意思，我刚才在吃螃蟹没在听！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_4eafac65:


    "螃蟹终结者（圣夜子）手上拿着螃蟹和蟹勺一脸迷茫地看过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_03_5ccbd871:


    "……我说怎么从刚才开始就一直很安静呢。"
